{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1075", "sample_idx": 11, "model_name": "mistralai/mistral-small-4-119b-2603", "content": "```json\n{\n  \"advertisement\": {\n    \"product_name\": \"SnuggleSoft Diapers\",\n    \"product_description\": \"Designed for ultimate comfort, SnuggleSoft Diapers feature ultra-soft materials, a gentle fit, and superior absorbency to keep your baby happy and dry.\",\n    \"key_features\": [\n      {\n        \"feature\": \"Ultra-Soft Material\",\n        \"description\": \"Made with hypoallergenic, breathable fabric to prevent irritation and ensure maximum comfort.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"feature\": \"Superior Absorbency\",\n        \"description\": \"Advanced moisture-lock technology keeps your baby dry for up to 12 hours.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"feature\": \"Gentle Fit\",\n        \"description\": \"Stretchy, contoured design with secure tabs to fit snugly without restricting movement.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"feature\": \"Eco-Friendly\",\n        \"description\": \"Biodegradable outer layer and chlorine-free materials for a safer planet.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"target_audience\": \"Parents of newborns to toddlers (0-36 months), especially those with sensitive skin or prone to diaper rash.\",\n    \"ad_copy\": {\n      \"headline\": \"The Diaper Your Baby Deserves!\",\n      \"subheadline\": \"Say goodbye to leaks and irritations with SnuggleSoft Diapers—where comfort meets care.\",\n      \"body\": \"Every parent wants what's best for their baby, and that starts with the perfect diaper. SnuggleSoft Diapers are designed with your little one's delicate skin in mind, offering unparalleled softness, a snug fit, and all-day protection. No more redness, no more discomfort—just pure, happy playtime. Plus, our eco-friendly materials give you peace of mind. Try SnuggleSoft today and give your baby the comfort they deserve!\",\n      \"call_to_action\": \"Shop now at SnuggleSoft.com or find us in stores nationwide!\",\n  